          keyPoints: [
            "Pod = 一组共网络/存储的容器（最小调度单位），实际里常 1 Pod 1 容器",
            "Deployment 声明副本数与镜像，负责滚动更新与自愈",
            "Service 给一组 Pod 提供稳定访问入口（ClusterIP/NodePort/LoadBalancer）",
            "声明式 API：提交 YAML，控制器持续把实际状态调到期望状态",
          ],
          example: {
            code: `apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: web
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels: { app: web }
  template:
    metadata:
      labels: { app: web }
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: web
          image: myregistry.com/team/myapp:1.0
          ports: [{ containerPort: 3000 }]
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: web-svc
spec:
  selector: { app: web }
  ports: [{ port: 80, targetPort: 3000 }]
`,
          },
        },
        {
          id: "docker-3-6",
          title: "kubectl 常用操作",
