        {
          id: "docker-4-2",
          title: "K8s 存储：PV / PVC / StorageClass",
          summary: "Pod 会漂移，数据要落盘：PVC 是申请，PV 是库存。",
          keyPoints: [
            "PVC（申请多大存储）与 PV（实际存储）自动绑定",
            "StorageClass 动态供给：申请即自动创建云盘",
            "Pod 通过 volumes.pvc 挂载；Read-write-Many 等访问模式要匹配",
            "StatefulSet + volumeClaimTemplates 给有状态应用每副本独立盘",
          ],
          example: {
            code: `apiVersion: v1
kind: PersistentVolumeClaim
metadata:
  name: db-data
spec:
  accessModes: [ReadWriteOnce]
  resources:
    requests: { storage: 10Gi }
  storageClassName: standard

# Deployment 挂载：volumes: [{ name: data, persistentVolumeClaim: { claimName: db-data } }]
`,
          },
        },
        {
          id: "docker-4-3",
          title: "探针：liveness / readiness / startup",
          summary: "三种探针各司其职，配错比不配更糟。",
          keyPoints: [
            "liveness 失败 → 重启容器；readiness 失败 → 摘出流量不重启",
            "startup 掩护慢启动应用，成功前不跑另外两个探针",
            "探针端点要轻量（/healthz），避免依赖下游（防雪崩）",
            "initialDelaySeconds 与启动耗时匹配，避免启动期误杀",
          ],
          example: {
            code: `containers:
  - name: web
    livenessProbe:
      httpGet: { path: /healthz, port: 3000 }
      initialDelaySeconds: 10
      periodSeconds: 15
    readinessProbe:
      httpGet: { path: /ready, port: 3000 }
      periodSeconds: 5
`,
          },
        },
        {
          id: "docker-4-4",
          title: "滚动发布与回滚",
          summary: "maxSurge/maxUnavailable 控制节奏，一条命令秒回滚。",
          keyPoints: [
            "默认滚动：先起新 Pod→就绪→再杀旧 Pod，业务无感",
            "maxSurge 超额数、maxUnavailable 不可用数，控制发布速度",
            "kubectl rollout history 查看版本，undo 一键回滚上一版",
            "发布前镜像必须已推仓库且换新 tag（别用 latest）",
          ],
          example: {
            code: `kubectl set image deploy/web web=myapp:1.1
