          keyPoints: [
            "HPA 依赖 metrics-server 采集指标",
            "targetCPUUtilizationPercentage 触发扩容，min/max 兜底",
            "扩容要配 Pod 资源 requests（HPA 按比例算）",
            "缩容到 0 是 Knative/Serverless 的领域，标准 HPA 有 minReplicas",
          ],
          example: {
            code: `apiVersion: autoscaling/v2
kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler
metadata:
  name: web-hpa
spec:
  scaleTargetRef: { apiVersion: apps/v1, kind: Deployment, name: web }
  minReplicas: 2
  maxReplicas: 10
  metrics:
    - type: Resource
      resource:
        name: cpu
        target: { type: Utilization, averageUtilization: 70 }
`,
          },
        },
        {
          id: "docker-4-6",
          title: "综合项目：Web 应用部署上 K8s",
          summary: "综合 23 课：多阶段镜像 + ConfigMap + 探针 + Service + HPA 完整上线。",
          keyPoints: [
            "步骤：多阶段构建镜像 → 推仓库 → ConfigMap/Secret → Deployment（探针+资源限额）→ Service → HPA",
            "先小流量验证（replicas=1），健康后扩容",
            "yaml 拆文件放 git，走 kubectl apply -f 目录（GitOps 雏形）",
            "排错链：get pods → describe → logs → 进容器 curl",
          ],
          example: {
            code: `# 1) 构建推送
docker build -t myregistry.com/team/myapp:1.2 . && docker push myregistry.com/team/myapp:1.2

# 2) 一键部署
kubectl apply -f k8s/
# k8s/ 目录：configmap.yaml secret.yaml deployment.yaml service.yaml hpa.yaml

# 3) 验证
kubectl get pods,svc,hpa
kubectl rollout status deploy/web
`,
